			"notes": "## Full config rewrite!\nYes, I know, I know... Another config update. This time I've rewritten the entire code. I'm not using the cloth config api anymore, instead only using spruceui.\n\nHere are some of the new config features:\n- New sidebar\n- New sliders, color option, text content, boolean toggles, etc.\n- Custom cursor\n- Separators\n- Semi transparent background\n- Hide instantly applied effects\n- And much much more!\n\nI decided to make the change from cloth config to spruceui because I wanted complete customization on my config screen, and I'm pretty happy about it.\n\n**Full Changelog**: https://github.com/StillLutto/potion-warning/compare/1.0.2...1.1.0"
		},
